Recommends: kwallet6
Description: Tokkl timer widget for the Plasma panel
 A Plasma 6 panel widget for Tokkl, a self-hosted time tracker with a Toggl
 Track compatible API. It signs in to an account on a Tokkl server, shows
 the running timer, starts and stops it, and sets the project and billable
 flag of the next or running entry.
 .
 The token or password is stored in KDE Wallet. Built for TUXEDO OS 24.04
 amd64 with Plasma 6.6, KDE Frameworks 6.24 and Qt 6.10.
